Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-28T22:14:32-07:00","id":1513162,"title":"","content":"Live by Matthew Dawkins on They Came From RPG Anthology, game release and the future of They Came. \ud83d\ude0e NOTICE - <b>New proposed They Came From ideas for Kickstarter NEED</b> to be on the Kickstarter comments to be considered. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/NiVTzc6aX5M?feature=share\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/live/NiVTzc6aX5M?feature=share</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-04T07:48:55-07:00","id":1513874,"title":"","content":"As someone who\u2019s watched way too many Uwe Boll style movies (last night it was Astonishing Tales of Adventure: Rocktapussy), I could have a lot of fun with a They Came from Uwe Boll!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-17T14:52:36-08:00","id":1547803,"title":"","content":"I don't know what I'd call it; but I would really love to see a They Came From\u2026 that's based around first responders, investigators, and lawyers: Blue Bloods, the entire Law &amp; Order franchise, Matlock, NCIS, Criminal Minds, CHiPs, Emergency 911, Magnum PI, and so on","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-18T18:33:26-08:00","id":1547824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/1404525-where-else-did-they-come-from?p=1547803#post1547803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know what I'd call it; but I would really love to see a They Came From\u2026 that's based around first responders, investigators, and lawyers: Blue Bloods, the entire Law &amp; Order franchise, Matlock, NCIS, Criminal Minds, CHiPs, Emergency 911, Magnum PI, and so on</div> </div> </div> </div>They Came From Central Dispatch?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-31T18:17:45-07:00","id":1560296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/1404525-where-else-did-they-come-from?p=1547824#post1547824\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They Came From Central Dispatch?</div> </div> </div> </div>They Came from the Government and They're Here to Help?<br /> <br /> Unlike this thread, which clearly came from beyond the grave. &gt;.&gt;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;At the risk of sounding like a murder hobo&quot;<br /> <br /> Attributed to Nyrufa.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24134-inertial-frame","name":"Inertial Frame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-03T04:25:53-07:00","id":1561230,"title":"","content":"Perhaps THEY CAME FROM THE FUNNY PAGES - a sourcebook looking at Newspaper comics and Cape comics of yore? (But perhaps with an eye to casting characte in the mould of Jimmy Olsen or Lois Lane or Jim Gordon &amp; Rene Montoya - characters who can keep up with superheroes and supervillains, but have to think fast and get lucky* to do so).<br /> <br /> Actually, you might even be able to get an adventure or three out of mere mortals helping to get a superhero through their Year One (and this sort of angle might be more in tune with the spirit of THEY CAME FROM\u2026).<br /> <br /> <br /> *<i>This wasn\u2019t intended as a euphemism, but given mention of Lois Lane it absolutely could be one.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-03T04:30:23-07:00","id":1561231,"title":"","content":"What about THEY CAME FROM THE NETHERWORLD as umbrella title for a sourcebook dealing with the BUFFY/TWILIGHT/SMALLVILLE sort of \u2018High school is Hell, growing up is murder\u2019 serial fiction? (With the mundane and the fantastical colliding with adolescent mayhem).<br /> <br /> I\u2019m not sure that title fits the subject perfectly, but I do think it\u2019s a title that would catch a few eyes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-03T04:34:01-07:00","id":1561232,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t really have any specific notions for these titles, but they occurred to me and I therefore share them:-<br /> <br /> - THEY CAME FROM BEYOND THE NETWORK<br /> <br /> - THEY CAME FROM THE DAWN OF TIME<br /> <br /> - THEY CAME FROM THE OTHERWORLD<br /> <br /> - THEY FROM OUT OF THE DAWN<br /> <br /> - THEY CAME FROM CENTRAL CASTING<br /> <br /> - THEY CAME FROM ON HIGH<br /> <br /> - THEY CAME FROM THE FRONT LINES","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}